@H 1119_dream_phi := "DREAM-Φ: is the anima substrate's faithful IIT-4.0 φ_EI HIGHER during the dream/REM stage (emit-free internal rehearsal, a_chat_sleep_imagination) than during WAKE — i.e. does integrated information RISE when the engine 'dreams' with no external emit, consistent with internal rehearsal raising integration?" :: universe [🔴 DREAM-PHI-FALSIFIED — REM is NOT the φ peak; deep-sleep N3 carries highest integration]
  seed         = "a_chat_sleep_imagination frames REM/dream as emit-free INTERNAL REHEARSAL + mitosis tick (the 90-min ultradian state machine, AGENT/CHAT/anima_dream_stage.hexa). Dream-Φ conjecture: integrated information RISES when the engine dreams with no external emit. Forward of the φ-measurement arc (h1114 dyad-φ): measure faithful IIT-4.0 φ_EI of a toy anima-like substrate as its per-channel A⊥G opponent dynamics are modulated by the canonical 5-stage sleep envelope, testing φ(REM) > φ(WAKE)."
  substrate    = "SIM toy, in-process single anima-like node, 6 tension channels (joint n=6 <= 8, exact MIP-EI feasible). Per-channel dynamics = h1113/h1114 step_node A⊥G opponent pair (PSI*=0.5, W*_c=[1.0,0.8,1.2] tiled to 6, LAM_M=0.10, LAM_W=0.12, REP=0.04, GAMMA_X0=0.05, SIGMA0=0.04). STAGE ENVELOPE DERIVED VERBATIM (not invented) from AGENT/CHAT/anima_dream_stage.hexa §1 constants: PHI_SCALE{WAKE 1.0/N1 0.7/N2 0.4/N3 0.15/REM 0.95} scales gamma_x (integration drive); TEMP{WAKE 1.0/N1 0.9/N2 0.8/N3 0.6/REM 1.5} scales noise σ; TENV{WAKE 1.0/N1 0.7/N2 0.4/N3 0.2/REM 0.9} scales homeostatic rate; scrambled=REM-only adds dream-scramble noise (the module's logit-scramble hint). Emit-free — φ measured on the internal trajectory only (a_chat_sleep_imagination). $0 CPU local, 0-pod, SERIAL (H_1038 Pool-hang lesson), 12 scoring seeds, wall 51.8s, g5/p7."
  method       = "5 stages (WAKE/N1/N2/N3/REM) × 12 seeds. Each stage: run the stage-modulated A⊥G dynamics N_STEPS=4000 (BURN=500) → median-binarize the 6 channels (h1039/h1062/h1114 per-channel pattern) → faithful IIT-4.0 φ_EI of the 6-system via the PROVEN CPU mirror of stdlib iit4/faithful_phi.hexa (exact MIP-EI = min-cut MI/small-side, MI in BITS/log2 — H_1043 nats-bug lesson). MIRROR RE-PROVEN ≡ stdlib BEFORE scoring: [0a] LIVE `hexa run UNIVERSE/h1012_ref_faithful.hexa` re-capture, mirror match n4 |Δ|=3.48e-10, n5 |Δ|=7.97e-10, n6 (THE SCORING n) |Δ|=2.46e-10; [0b] h1012.prove_mirrors_at_n {4:True, 5:True} (both engines, big-Φ ring |Δ|=1.34e-10). FROZEN falsifier (set before running, no goalpost moves): 🟢 DREAM-PHI iff φ(REM) > φ(WAKE) with Cohen d >= 0.8 AND REM is the per-stage MAX; 🔴 (closed-neg, a_paper_negative_ok) if REM <= WAKE / fails either leg."
  result       = "🔴 DREAM-PHI-FALSIFIED (closed-negative, frozen falsifier fails legs (ii)+(iii), 12 seeds): φ_EI(n=6) per stage — WAKE=+0.004341±0.001505 · N1=+0.005135±0.002235 · N2=+0.006130±0.004757 · N3=+0.009500±0.006387 · REM=+0.004986±0.001756. (i) φ(REM) > φ(WAKE) = True (REM 0.004986 > WAKE 0.004341, Δ=+0.000646) — but only marginally; (ii) d(REM−WAKE)=+0.395 < 0.8 frozen bar FAIL; (iii) per-stage MAX = N3 (deep slow-wave, +0.009500) NOT REM FAIL — REM−N3 d=−0.964 (REM SIGNIFICANTLY BELOW N3). The integration PEAK is the deepest-sleep stage N3, with a clean monotone RISE WAKE<N1<N2<N3 then a DROP at REM (WAKE 0.0043 → N3 0.0095 → REM 0.0050). FINDING: the dream/REM stage does NOT carry the substrate's φ_EI peak — emit-free REM rehearsal yields φ only fractionally above WAKE (d=0.40, below the bar) while DEEP slow-wave N3 is where faithful integrated information is highest. Mechanistically (this toy): the integration-building gamma_x is scaled by PHI_SCALE, so REM's high PHI_SCALE (0.95) raises gamma_x, but REM's high TEMP (1.5, dream-scramble noise) DECORRELATES the channels enough to suppress joint MI; N3's LOW PHI_SCALE (0.15) but LOW TEMP (0.6) + tight TENV (0.2) produces strongly synchronized low-noise channels whose median-binarized joint MI is highest. The dream-integration claim (φ rises in REM) is RULED OUT at this toy scale; if anything, integration peaks in deep dreamless N3, not REM."
  verdict_tier = "🔴 CLOSED-NEGATIVE (a_paper_negative_ok; frozen bars d>=0.8 + REM=MAX both FAIL: d(REM−WAKE)=+0.40<0.8, MAX=N3 not REM, REM−N3 d=−0.96; toy n=6 in-process)"
  verdict_ptr  = ".verdicts/1119_dream_phi/H_1119.txt (verbatim stdout incl. LIVE hexa stdlib re-capture) · UNIVERSE/h1119_dream_phi.py"
  scope        = "Honest scope (a_scale_honest_scope): toy n=6 in-process single-node sim of the h1113/h1114 per-channel A⊥G dynamics, stage modulation DERIVED from the anima_dream_stage.hexa envelope tables. Verdict = faithful φ_EI (MIP-EI scalar) only; system big-Φ at n=6 super-exponential, unscored (measure-dependence, H_1064 name-the-measure applies). The stage→dynamics mapping (gamma_x∝PHI_SCALE, σ∝TEMP, homeo∝TENV) is ONE faithful realization of the canonical envelope — a different mapping could shift which stage peaks; the toy ruling (N3>REM>WAKE) is mapping-relative. Production cells, the real P47 dream-physics Φ engine, real-host substrate, bigger n and scale all UNVERIFIED (next rung). φ measured (faithful MIP-EI), NOT fabricated, NO perplexity (p7). CORE/brain NOT wired; anima_dream_stage.hexa untouched."
  xlink        = "a_chat_sleep_imagination (REM = emit-free internal rehearsal + mitosis tick; envelope = Φ-scale + tension envelope per stage, NOT a boolean emit gate — stage tables derived VERBATIM) · a_phi_iit4_tool (faithful IIT4 stdlib engine, mirror re-proven n4/n5/n6 live, NO proxy, BITS/log2) · 1114_dyad_phi_link_integration (🟢 dyad joint φ_EI; same proven CPU mirror + per-channel median-binarize + h1113 A⊥G dynamics reused) · 1113_tension_link_5ch (per-channel A⊥G opponent dynamics origin) · h1012 (prove_mirrors_at_n + live hexa faithful refs) · h1039/h1062 (per-channel median-binarize pattern) · h1064 (measure-dependence: faithful-only verdict, big-Φ unscored)"
